    {
      "id": 20072,
      "name": "themetallian",
      "username": "themetallian",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/themetallian/{size}/1936_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-07-23T22:03:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I tried searching the Gen Con event system and Google to find information on this and couldn't find anything. I knew I'd heard something about it on the podcast, so I sniffed around the Sentinels Wiki and found the details in the <a href=\"https://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Podcasts/Episode_150#tab=Quicknotes\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Episode 150 notes</a>. I figured I'd post it here so it was easier for people to find.</p>\n<p>It looks like it's going to be on Friday, Jul 31, 2020 at 11:00 AM Central time. It says it'll be on YouTube using the YouTube chat. I assume this means it'll be on <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/GreaterThanGames\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">the Greater Than Games YouTube channel</a>.</p>\n<p>EDIT: According to <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-152-creative-process-argent-adepts-supporting-cast\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">the show notes for episode #152</a>, the link to the event will be posted on <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/theletterspage/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page Patreon</a>.</p>\n<p>Please feel free to correct me if I've gotten any details wrong!</p>\n<p>The Metallian</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:54:01.545Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
