      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I tried searching the Gen Con event system and Google to find information on this and couldn't find anything. I knew I'd heard something about it on the podcast, so I sniffed around the Sentinels Wiki and found the details in the <a href=\"https://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Podcasts/Episode_150#tab=Quicknotes\">Episode 150 notes</a>. I figured I'd post it here so it was easier for people to find.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It looks like it's going to be on Friday, Jul 31, 2020 at 11:00 AM Central time. It says it'll be on YouTube using the YouTube chat. I assume this means it'll be on <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/GreaterThanGames\">the Greater Than Games YouTube channel</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>EDIT: According to <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-152-creative-process-argent-adepts-supporting-cast\">the show notes for episode #152</a>, the link to the event will be posted on <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/theletterspage/\">The Letters Page Patreon</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Please feel free to correct me if I've gotten any details wrong!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Metallian</p>",
